Package: interlace
Version: 1.9.8
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, python
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/codingo/Interlace
Description: Turn single-threaded CLI tools into fast multi-threaded engines
 interlace runs a given command across a list of targets (comma,
 CIDR or glob notation), adding threading, exclusions, timeouts and
 port replication. Ideal for batch-scanning many hosts with nmap,
 nuclei or any one-shot CLI scanner without rewriting them.
